request.description:
Verify an active Monzo connection exists before attempting sync.

Expected (if connected):
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "connected": true,
    "connectionCount": 1,
    "tokenStatus": "VALID"
  }
}
```

If `connected: false` — complete OAuth first.

Run this before triggering sync to establish baseline.

This hits status (a live endpoint). Use the DB queries below to check account/transaction counts:

```sql
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM monzo_accounts;
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM monzo_transactions;
```

Expected when the authenticated user has no active Monzo connection.

**Setup:** Quick-login as a different email (e.g. `nomonzo@example.com`) before running this.

Expected:
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "error": {
    "code": "RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND",
    "message": "No active Monzo connection found for user ..."
  }
}
```
